        "thought_text": "Consider counting the number of tiles divisible by both a and b separately, as they can be painted either Red or Blue. Then, calculate the number of tiles divisible by a but not by b, and those divisible by b but not by a. Finally, maximize the chocolates by choosing the optimal color for the tiles divisible by both a and b.",
